      "id": "ecf7329c-c4eb-4453-95e0-a784beef2758",
      "text": "Any recurrent network can be unfolded into a feed-forward network with the same input-output behavior. A theory that ties consciousness to causal structure rather than function is then either false or outside science, since no experiment can tell the two networks apart.",
